talk start time:1:14 pm on 25 May, 2023memory content: Speaker Melaniesays : Wow, Caroline! That's awesome! Taking in kids in need - you're so kind. Your future family is gonna be so lucky to have you!memory context: The speaker praises Caroline for her kindness in taking in children in need, expressing that her future family will be fortunate to have her, in the context of Caroline choosing an adoption agency for its inclusivity and support of LGBTQ+ individuals.memory keywords: ['kids in need', 'kindness', 'future family', 'taking in', 'lucky']memory tags: ['kindness', 'adoption', 'family planning', 'encouragement', 'kids in need', 'LGBTQ+ support', 'inclusivity']
talk start time:10:31 am on 13 October, 2023memory content: Speaker Carolinesays : Thanks, Melanie! I'm stoked to start this new chapter. It's been a dream to adopt and provide a safe, loving home for kids who need it. Do you have any experience with adoption, or know anyone who's gone through the process?memory context: Caroline expresses excitement about adopting and providing a safe, loving home for children in need, and asks Melanie whether she has any experience with or knowledge of the adoption process.memory keywords: ['adoption', 'safe home', 'loving home', 'kids', 'process', 'experience', 'new chapter']memory tags: ['adoption', 'safe home', 'loving home', 'kids', 'process', 'experience', 'new chapter', 'family planning', 'personal aspiration', 'gratitude', 'hopeful', 'support', 'encouragement']
talk start time:1:14 pm on 25 May, 2023memory content: Speaker Carolinesays : Thanks, Melanie! Your kind words really mean a lot. I'll do my best to make sure these kids have a safe and loving home.memory context: Caroline thanks Melanie for her kind words and promises to do her best to provide a safe and loving home for the children.memory keywords: ['safe home', 'loving home', 'kids', 'kind words', 'best']memory tags: ['gratitude', 'adoption', 'encouragement', 'loving home', 'kids in need', 'personal aspiration', 'hopeful', 'family planning']
talk start time:1:14 pm on 25 May, 2023memory content: Speaker Melaniesays : Wow, that agency looks great! What made you pick it?memory context: A speaker expresses enthusiasm about an agency and asks what motivated the other person's selection of it, prompting the explanation that it was chosen for helping LGBTQ+ individuals with adoption and for its inclusivity and support.memory keywords: ['agency', 'pick', 'choice']memory tags: ['adoption', 'adoption agencies', 'agency choice', 'curiosity', 'encouragement', 'support', 'LGBTQ+ support', 'inclusivity']
talk start time:1:14 pm on 25 May, 2023memory content: Speaker Carolinesays : [Image: a photography of a sign for a new arrival and an information and domestic building] Thanks, Mel! My goal is to give kids a loving home. I'm truly grateful for all the support I've got from friends and mentors. Now the hard work starts to turn my dream into a reality. And here's one of the adoption agencies I'm looking into. It's a lot to take in, but I'm feeling hopeful and optimistic.memory context: The speaker shares her goal of adopting children to give them a loving home, expresses gratitude for support from friends and mentors, and mentions researching an adoption agency—later specifying she chose it for its inclusivity and support of LGBTQ+ individuals—while feeling hopeful about turning her dream into reality.memory keywords: ['adoption', 'adoption agencies', 'loving home', 'support', 'hopeful', 'optimistic', 'dream', 'hard work']memory tags: ['adoption', 'adoption agencies', 'loving home', 'support', 'hopeful', 'optimistic', 'dream', 'hard work', 'family planning', 'personal aspiration', 'LGBTQ+ support', 'inclusivity']
talk start time:1:14 pm on 25 May, 2023memory content: Speaker Carolinesays : Researching adoption agencies — it's been a dream to have a family and give a loving home to kids who need it.memory context: The speaker shares their dream of building a family by researching adoption agencies to provide a loving home to children in need, later explaining that they chose an agency for its inclusivity and support of LGBTQ+ individuals with adoption.memory keywords: ['adoption agencies', 'family', 'loving home', 'researching', 'kids']memory tags: ['adoption', 'family planning', 'personal aspiration', 'social services', 'LGBTQ+ support', 'inclusivity']

